<div class="page">
  <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Field notes</p><h1>Gustave and Nhar’s diary</h1><p class="prose">Two travel diaries survive: dispatches from the 2000 Canadian fringe circuit and a 2010 journey toward <em>Cabaret Terrarium</em> in Brooklyn.</p><p class="prose note">Editorial note: the 2000 diary preserves its original bracketed substitutions, including <code>[the Great One]</code> and <code>[the One True Song]</code>. They belong to the historical record and connect directly to <a href="/shows/#letters-title">the cease-and-desist history of <em>Motel California</em></a>.</p></header>
  <div class="diary-years">
